- Production backend: Apps Script **Version 13** (Code.gs SHA-256 prefix `1e11c25d0bb738ff` = `backups/Code.gs.pre71.bak`). Production frontend: Netlify **`6ab097334eab6fae293bd100`** (== local `frontend/`, unchanged by 7.1).
- **Local backend is AHEAD of production:** `apps-script/Code.gs` prefix `e7e80b63fb178319` adds `pace_period_end` (backend only; no UI can set it yet).
